---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const crumbs = [{ label: 'Home', href: `${base}/` }, { label: 'Privacy policy' }];
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="What data Global Sports Archive collects, how advertising and analytics cookies are used, and the rights you have over your data under the GDPR." crumbs={crumbs}>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="block">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="note">
        ЗАМЕСТИТЕЛ — текстът по-долу е работна рамка, не юридически документ. Преди
        пускане се допълва с реалните данни на издателя и се преглежда от юрист.
      </p>

      <h2>Who is responsible</h2>
      <p>ЗАМЕСТИТЕЛ — име и данни на администратора на лични данни.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Analytics.</strong> Aggregate data about visits, through Google Analytics 4.</li>
        <li><strong>Advertising.</strong> Our advertising partners may set cookies to serve and measure ads.</li>
        <li><strong>Theme preference.</strong> Stored in your browser only. It never reaches our servers.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We do not run accounts, newsletters or comments, so we hold no names, passwords
        or email addresses.
      </p>

      <h2>Consent</h2>
      <p>
        Visitors in the European Economic Area and the United Kingdom are asked for
        consent before any advertising or analytics cookie is set, through a consent
        platform certified under the IAB Transparency and Consent Framework. Consent can
        be changed at any time from the link in the footer.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the GDPR you may request access to your data, its correction or erasure,
        and object to its processing. Requests go to the address on our
        <a href={`${base}/contact/`}>contact page</a>. You also have the right to
        complain to a supervisory authority.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>Material changes to this policy will be noted on this page with the date of the change.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
